      "text": "The functions \\( f \\) and \\( g \\) are defined for all real numbers. The table gives the one-sided limits of each function as \\( x \\) approaches 1 and the value of each function at \\( x = 1 \\). \\[ \\begin{array}{c|ccc} & \\displaystyle \\lim_{x \\to 1^{-}} & \\displaystyle \\lim_{x \\to 1^{+}} & \\text{value at } x = 1 \\\\ \\hline f & 4 & 4 & 2 \\\\ g & -2 & 3 & 3 \\end{array} \\]"
   },
