      {
         "id": "b",
         "prompt": "Find \\( \\displaystyle \\lim_{x \\to 1^{-}} \\left( \\left[ g(x) \\right]^{2} - g(x) \\right) \\) and \\( \\displaystyle \\lim_{x \\to 1^{+}} \\left( \\left[ g(x) \\right]^{2} - g(x) \\right) \\). Does \\( \\displaystyle \\lim_{x \\to 1} \\left( \\left[ g(x) \\right]^{2} - g(x) \\right) \\) exist? If it exists, give its value.",
         "setup_required": false,
         "answer_latex": "\\lim_{x \\to 1} \\left( \\left[ g(x) \\right]^{2} - g(x) \\right) = 6",
         "worked_solution": [
            {
               "text": "Left-hand limit.",
               "latex": "\\lim_{x \\to 1^{-}} \\left( \\left[ g(x) \\right]^{2} - g(x) \\right) = (-2)^{2} - (-2) = 6"
