               "text": "Right-hand limit.",
               "latex": "\\lim_{x \\to 1^{+}} \\left( \\left[ g(x) \\right]^{2} - g(x) \\right) = 3^{2} - 3 = 6"
            },
            {
               "text": "The one-sided limits agree, so the limit exists.",
               "latex": "\\lim_{x \\to 1} \\left( \\left[ g(x) \\right]^{2} - g(x) \\right) = 6"
            }
